{\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 31, \"text\": \"rocketry, radar, and computing.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 32, \"end\": 244, \"text\": \"Berkner and Chapman proposed to the International Council of Scientific Unions that an International Geophysical Year (IGY) be planned for 1957–58, coinciding with an approaching period of maximum solar activity.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 245, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"In 1952, the IGY was announced.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 376, \"text\": \"Joseph Stalin's death in 1953 opened the way for international collaboration with the Soviet Union.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 377, \"end\": 402, \"text\": \"On 29 July 1955, James C.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 403, \"end\": 431, \"text\": \"Hagerty, president Dwight D.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"start\": 432, \"end\": 668, \"text\": \"Eisenhower's press secretary, announced that the United States intended to launch \\\"small Earth circling satellites\\\" between 1 July 1957 and 31 December 1958 as part of the United States contribution to the International Geophysical Year\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 617, \"text\": \"INTERNATIONAL GEOPHYSICAL YEAR Definition & Meaning | Dictionary.com Games Daily Crossword Word Puzzle Word Finder All games Featured Word of the Day Synonym of the Day Word of the Year New words Language stories All featured Pop culture Slang Emoji Memes Acronyms Gender and sexuality All pop culture Writing tips Writing hub Grammar essentials Commonly confused All writing tips Games Featured Pop culture Writing tips Advertisement Skip to Skip to International Geophysical Year noun ( 1 ) Advertisement International Geophysical Year noun the 18-month period from July 1 , 1957 , to Dec 31 , 1958 , during which a\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 125, \"text\": \"activity and expanded its geographical range, including to peripheral cities and towns in the south and north of the country.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 126, \"end\": 272, \"text\": \"In 2010, the Ministry of Education recognized volunteer work in the organization as part of the mandatory volunteer hours in Israeli high schools.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 273, \"end\": 320, \"text\": \"Today, Waizmann functions as IGY's chairperson.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 321, \"end\": 411, \"text\": \"Additional leaders include Gal Uchovsky, and Avner Dafni who serves as executive director.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 412, \"end\": 472, \"text\": \"Offices are located in the Gay Community Center in Tel Aviv.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d02\", \"start\": 473, \"end\": 648, \"text\": \"The organization is one of the largest in the local LGBT community, collaborating extensively with Tehila, and organization of parents and friends of LGBT, and Hoshen (Israeli\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 136, \"text\": \"in strikes protesting the exclusion of gay men from a recently passed surrogacy law , as they were considered political demonstrations .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d03\", \"start\": 137, \"end\": 447, \"text\": \"[ 14 ] Acceptance in everyday life sometimes differs from regulations ; a poll conducted in 2011 by the Israel Gay Youth found that 40 % of gay soldiers said they were verbally harassed for their sexual orientation , 20 % said they had been sexually harassed , and 4 % said they had been physically assaulted .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d03\", \"start\": 448, \"end\": 545, \"text\": \"Some , such as Noa Halevi , a reserves officer , say that female gay soldiers have an easier time\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 36, \"text\": \"Torah prescribes the death penalty .\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d04\", \"start\": 37, \"end\": 248, \"text\": \"[ 158 ] In July 2019 , a 16-year-old teenager who lives in the Beit Dror LGBT center in Tel Aviv was stabbed several times and seriously wounded by his brother for refusing to adopt `` a religious lifestyle '' .\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d04\", \"start\": 249, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"Israel Gay Youth ( IGY ) called the stabbing a hate crime .\"}, \"D5S4\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d04\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 424, \"text\": \"[ 159 ] The condition of the victim stabilized after he underwent surgery at the Tel Aviv Sourasky Medical Center .\"}, \"D5S5\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d04\", \"start\": 425, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"Media reported that the victim and two suspects were all Muslim brothers from the Arab town of Tamra in\"}, \"D6S1\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 29, \"text\": \"with Protein A and Protein G.\"}, \"D6S2\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 127, \"text\": \"Thus, it cannot be separated from other components of the assay, for example from other proteins.\"}, \"D6S3\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 128, \"end\": 211, \"text\": \"Additionally, the egg yolk's rich store of lipids and lipoproteins must be removed.\"}, \"D6S4\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 212, \"end\": 354, \"text\": \"Antibody-containing blood serums, on the other hand, can sometimes be directly used in bioanalysis, i.e., without complicated isolation steps.\"}, \"D6S5\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 355, \"end\": 457, \"text\": \"Particularly in Asian countries, IgY has been clinically tested as a food supplement and preservative.\"}, \"D6S6\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d05\", \"start\": 458, \"end\": 662, \"text\": \"For example, yogurt products containing pathogen specific IgY, have been tested for their ability to reduce \\\"Helicobacter pylori\\\" in the stomach by hindering the attachment of the bacterial to the stomach\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"IGY\", \"scope\": \"abbreviation\", \"claim\": \"The abbreviation \\\"IGY\\\" stands for International Geophysical Year.\", \"answer\": \"International Geophysical Year\", \"quote\": \"Berkner and Chapman proposed to the International Council of Scientific Unions that an International Geophysical Year (IGY) be planned for 1957–58, coinciding with an approaching period of maximum solar activity.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0430-c6a597edf26d:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"IGY\", \"scope\": \"abbreviation\", \"claim\": \"The abbreviation \\\"IGY\\